1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,702
Can a person stay awake for 11 days?

2
00:00:03,752 --> 00:00:12,623
In 1964, Randy Gardner of San Diego stayed awake for 264 hours.

3
00:00:12,673 --> 00:00:18,404
Stanford sleep scientist Dr. William Dement kept watch over him.

4
00:00:18,454 --> 00:00:22,441
The record was broken about two weeks later, and Guinness stopped tracking it, because it is dangerous.
